'''Treasure Chests''', also known simply as '''Chests''', are recurring [[Object]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}, appearing in every title since {{ALttP}}. Found in both the [[Overworld]] and in [[Dungeons]], each Treasure Chest (with the exception of [[Treasure Chest#Traps|Traps]]) contains an item that will aid [[Link]] on his quest. Smaller Chests usually contain common items and collectibles such as [[Small Key]]s, [[Bomb]]s, [[Arrow]]s, and various amounts of [[Rupee]]s. Larger Chests contain rarer, more important items, such as equipment, [[Big Key]]s, [[Piece of Heart|Pieces of Heart]], and large sums of Rupees. Some Chests are locked or otherwise guarded; some will only appear after the completion of a [[Puzzle]] in the same room.

