==Other Appearances==
==={{PH|-}} (Himekawa)===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
[[Ciela]] finds a big Treasure Chest in the [[Temple of the Ocean King]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= Link, over here! There's a...Big Treasure Chest!|book= {{PH (Himekawa)|-}}|publisher= VIZ Media|page= 35}}</ref> Link carries the Chest outside of the Temple while fleeing a [[Phantom]]. [[Linebeck]] opens it to find the [[Phantom Hourglass]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= That is indeed the treasure. It's the Phantom Hourglass!|book= {{PH (Himekawa)|-}}|publisher= VIZ Media|page= 38}}</ref> Another Treasure Chest is found by Link and Ciela on the [[Isle of Ember]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= Look!|book= {{PH (Himekawa)|-}}|publisher= VIZ Media|page= 56}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Book|quote= A Treasure Chest?!|book= {{PH (Himekawa)|-}}|publisher= VIZ Media|page= 56}}</ref> This Treasure Chest houses the [[Boomerang]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= A Boomerang!|book= {{PH (Himekawa)|-}}|publisher= VIZ Media|page= 56}}</ref>
{{Noncanon|End}}

